{"event": "turn", "session_id": "ccf[号码]b453087c4119a75e0f623", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T07:29:42.404690+00:00", "message": "Introduce black tea and its processing.", "resolved_question": "Introduce black tea and its processing.", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 15.521, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 5833, "output_tokens": 975, "response": {"answer": "**红茶及其加工简介**\n\n**红茶是什么**\n红茶属于经过较充分酶促氧化的茶类。按 ISO 20715:2023 的分类，红茶加工包括萎凋、揉捻或切碎（maceration）、通气/氧化、干燥几个步骤（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）。\n\n**加工步骤**\n1. **萎凋**：使鲜叶失水、变软，为后续工序做准备。\n2. **揉捻或切碎**：破坏叶片组织，让内含物质与空气接触。\n3. **通气/氧化**：茶叶中的酶在有氧条件下发生氧化反应。\n4. **干燥**：终止氧化并固定品质。\n\n**关于“发酵”一词的说明**\n在红茶贸易和制茶行业中，“发酵”通常指叶片破损并接触空气后发生的**酶促氧化**，并不一定指微生物发酵。这也是红茶常被称为“氧化茶”的原因（来源：ISO 20715:2023；Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea）。\n\n作为对比：绿茶几乎不进行有意氧化，乌龙茶为部分氧化，黑茶则可能包含单独的渥堆/后发酵阶段（来源：Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea；ISO 20715:2023）。\n\n**一个产地实例**\n一项关于伊朗吉兰（Gilan）红茶的研究把其加工步骤描述为萎凋、揉捻、发酵（氧化）、干燥；该研究比较的是冲泡方法和实验室条件下的化学性质，并未确立对消费者的健康功效（来源：Processing and brewing of Gilan black tea, Journal of Food Science and Technology）。\n\n**补充说明**\n- 上述来源均未标注具体年份，故无法提供资料年份。\n- 关于红茶的风味、用途等属性，本次工具未提供可验证信息，无法确认。\n- 如需了解具体红茶商品的价格与库存，请提供商品信息，我将按实时数据查询。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/fr/records/6473b0a3542a3f9f03b31231", "year": null}, {"title": "Processing and brewing of Gilan black tea, Journal of Food Science and Technology", "url": "https://fsct.modares.ac.ir/files/fsct/user_files_749497/re1farahmand-A-10-20521-12-52bc60a.pdf", "year": null}, {"title": "Typology of Processed Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/zh/records/68cbbca2f61e5b80b5e93a95", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "Introduce black tea and its processing.", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "rules"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "diagnostics": [], "compliance_blocked": false, "explained_categories": [], "pii_redacted": false}, "retrieval": [{"original_query": "Introduce black tea and its processing.", "rewrite_status": ["translated"], "rewrite_error_types": [], "rejected_variants": 0, "queries": [{"round": 0, "query": "Introduce black tea and its processing.", "limit": 15, "hits": 15, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "介绍红茶及其加工工艺。", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "Introduce black tea and its processing. | 红茶 加工", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "红茶是什么?它的加工工艺是怎样的?", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}], "rerank_status": ["success"], "retry": false, "retry_adopted": false, "retry_reasons": [], "selected_ids": ["64", "81", "62", "69", "77"], "remaining_issues": [], "missing_subjects": []}]}
